    "Users are advised to assess their threat perception before enabling biometric authentication. Don't enable this if you're storing state secrets! Visit FAQs for more information.": "建議使用者在啟用生物辨識身分驗證之前，先評估其威脅感知程度。如果您儲存國家機密，請勿啟用此功能！請至常見問題頁面瞭解更多資訊。",
