    "{argsType}, Needed for route: {route}": "{argsType}，路徑需要：{route}",
    "Do you want to import {noOfNotesInImport} new notes?": "你想要匯入 {noOfNotesInImport} 個新筆記嗎？",
    "There is no way to decrypt these notes without the passphrase. With great security comes the great responsibility of remembering the passphrase!": "沒有密碼是無法解密這些筆記的。由於具有極高的安全性，也就有了記住密碼口令的重大責任！",
    "If the Notes in your backup file was encrypted with different passphrase then you'll be prompted to enter the passphrase of the device that generated backup.": "如果備份檔案中的筆記使用不同的密碼口令加密，則會提示您輸入生成備份的裝置的密碼口令。",
    "When turned on, the content on the screen is treated as secure, blocking background snapshots and preventing it from appearing in screenshots or from being viewed on non-secure displays.": "開啟時，會阻擋螢幕截圖，以避免其出現在非安全顯示環境中。",
    "Passphrase is similar to password but generally longer, it will be used to encrypt and decrypt your notes. Use strong passphrase and make sure to remember it. It is impossible to decrypt your notes without the passphrase. With great security comes the great responsibility of remembering the passphrase!": "密碼口令類似於密碼，但通常更長，將用於加密與解密您的筆記。請使用強大的密碼並確保牢記在心，沒有密碼就無法解密您的筆記。伴隨著極高的安全性而來的，是必須記住密碼的重大責任！",
    "AppBackupDescription": "這將建立一個經過加密的本地備份，該備份會每日自動更新。此外，此備份的設計讓它能與其他開源工具（如 SyncThing）一起使用，以便在本地網路上的不同裝置上保留多個冗餘備份。\n若要切換到新裝置，您只需將此備份檔案複製到新裝置，並將其匯入新的萝笺 App 即可。\n如需詳細資訊，請參閱常見問題解答。",
