    "Start to view local logs in a PC browser in real time, no export needed.\nSuitable for mobile (where SD card export is limited).\n\nThe server is a global singleton; leaving this page does not stop it, only manual stop or app exit does.\n\nEndpoints:\n  /            → Real-time log viewer (WebSocket)\n  /logs        → Full log text (downloadable via curl)\n  /diagnostics → Diagnostics snapshot text": "啟動後即可在 PC 瀏覽器中即時查看本機日誌，無需匯出檔案。\n適用於行動裝置（SD 卡匯出受限的場景）。\n\n伺服器為全球單例，離開此頁面也不會停止，唯有手動停止或應用程式退出時才會關閉。\n\n端點：\n  /            → 即時日誌檢視器（WebSocket）\n  /logs        → 全量日誌文字內容（可透過 curl 下載）\n  /diagnostics → 診斷快照文字",
    "Security note: the server binds 0.0.0.0, so any device on the same LAN can access it. Logs do not contain sensitive information such as passwords/tokens. Currently in debug stage, the server starts automatically with the sync service; release builds will default to off.": "安全提醒：伺服器已綁定 0.0.0.0，同一區域網路內的裝置皆可存取。日誌中不包含密碼/Token 等敏感資訊。目前處於除錯階段，伺服器會隨同步服務自動啟動；正式發布版本將改為預設關閉狀態。",
